(text "AUDIO_EN drives all four /OE pins.\nU801/U805 powered from MIC_3V3; exact Ioff-rated vendor." (at 21.59 156.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "68452ce6-88de-5c44-b393-6c6a152f3d00"))
(text "8 ohm / 2W selected speaker. Both BTL wires float.\n6dB gain; playback in LEFT slot; initial output cap 0.5W." (at 213.36 151.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "727d1ab7-dd6e-50bc-b132-73c5a78c83ae"))
(text "LR and CONFIG strapped LOW. SD pull-down before AON return buffer." (at 21.59 260.35 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8f51fe5e-58f4-5c76-8c32-c5ad89302847"))
(text "48kHz / 2 x 32-bit I2S slots / 64fs.\nMute -> enable rails -> clocks/zero data\n-> discard startup frames -> unmute.\n\nOFF: mute, finish audio, stop clocks,\ndrive safe levels, then AUDIO_EN=0.\nVerify low-battery THD, pop, rail decay,\nSD_MODE injection and acoustic port.\n\nNo 5V audio boost; no new firmware." (at 267.97 184.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cb315536-4cc9-5369-be86-684c574e0a79"))
